title Scripted flank
about Red pushes into blue's line; blue's raiders wait to the north, then hit red's flank.

scenario skirmish
units 0                      # only what the script spawns
respawn off
bot blue off
bot red off
clip 0..900
camera 250,240 150

at 0    spawn blue tank 40 at 200,256 radius 12
at 0    spawn blue artillery 20 at 170,256 radius 10
at 0    spawn blue raider 50 at 205,215 radius 9
at 0    spawn red tank 50 at 290,256 radius 14
at 0    spawn red artillery 20 at 330,256 radius 10

at 1    select blue raider as flank
at 1    select red tank as push
at 1    select red artillery as red_guns

at 2    attack-move push 200,256     # red advances on blue's line, which holds
at 2    attack-move red_guns 262,256
at 2    move flank 248,196           # raiders slip north of red's advance
at 330  attack-move flank 300,262    # then into red's side

at 330  expect flank alive >= 45     # waiting out of range kept them whole
at 880  expect red units == 0       # the flank broke them
